[_description]
Package: de.sean.blockprot.nbt. BlockProt NBT test docstrings.

[_summary]
Test-scope stubs for BlockProt NBT classes. Minimal stubs required for loading BlockProt handler classes in tests without the actual BlockProt plugin.

[_does]
Provides FriendModifyAction and LockReturnValue stubs so Mockito/ByteBuddy can inspect BlockProt handler class hierarchy without ClassNotFoundException.

[_careful]

[_careful/Compatibility]
Real BlockProt runtime provides these types; tests only need them to exist for class loading and Mockito inspection.

[_conclusions]
Stubs enable BlockProt integration testing without requiring the actual BlockProt plugin at runtime.

